{"indicator":"participation","unit":"%","years":[1990,1991,1992,1993,1994,1995,1996,1997,1998,1999,2000,2001,2002,2003,2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025],"projectionFrom":2025,"notes":{"TWN":"ILO 的模型估計也有台灣，2024 年以前跟主計總處的數字相同，之後是 ILO 的推算（2025 年 59.31%，主計總處 59.43%）。台灣改用主計總處人力資源調查的數字（2025 年 59.43%）。調查範圍是臺灣地區（不含金門、連江）15 歲以上的民間人口，不含現役軍人與監管人口；失業者是無工作、隨時可以工作、正在找工作（或已找到工作還沒開始）的人，跟 ILO 的定義相同。就業者含每週工作 15 小時以上的無酬家屬工作者。2025 年其他國家是 ILO 的推估，台灣是主計總處的實際值。"},"notesEn":{"TWN":"The ILO modelled estimates include Taiwan and match DGBAS up to 2024; later years are ILO estimates (59.31% in 2025 against DGBAS's 59.43%). Taiwan's figures come from DGBAS's Manpower Survey (59.43% in 2025). The survey covers the civilian population aged 15 and over in Taiwan proper (excluding Kinmen and Lienchiang), so the armed forces and institutionalised people are left out; the unemployed are people without work who are available and looking for work (or waiting to start a job they have found), the same as the ILO definition. Unpaid family workers count as employed if they work 15 hours a week or more. For 2025, other countries are ILO projections while Taiwan's is the actual figure."},"encoding":"delta","aggregates":{"WLD":[-2,6554,-10,-13,-26,-7,-11,-13,-7,-11,2,-14,-20,-18,-13,-9,-8,-22,-17,-25,-27,-28,-16,-24,-18,-21,-12,-16,-19,-13,-14,-139,75,30,34,-6,-16]},"values":{"AFG":[-2,4719,-5,-5,-7,-7,-7,-8,-7,-6,-6,-5,-3,-2,-1,1,2,4,5,6,7,6,7,8,7,7,6,7,7,-173,-176,-223,-90,-304,-5,-4,-9],"AGO":[-2,7727,4,3,3,3,2,0,-1,-2,-1,-2,-2,-2,-2,-2,-1,-1,-1,0,1,0,5,-27,-28,-29,-28,-29,-29,-29,-30,-170,305,-112,-36,-1,-9],"ALB":[-2,6369,462,105,-148,-128,-187,-126,148,-124,-165,-90,-103,-52,-105,-106,-107,-108,-108,-108,180,21,474,-295,-457,100,208,181,75,124,101,-94,31,248,172,13,25],"ARE":[-2,7435,30,30,53,33,35,-13,-67,-48,-28,-9,14,34,48,59,65,51,10,-26,-46,4,23,18,28,34,33,45,31,35,36,-69,-173,19,113,11,11],"ARG":[-2,5909,88,75,77,52,-50